SegScope-based usage-trace analysis application for CasOS.

This application uses selected sources from https://github.com/zhangxin00/segscope
at revision 32d6885b0bc8c0ab2f79c207cdfba056e8ae055d, licensed under MIT.
See third_party/segscope/LICENSE and SOURCE.json for attribution and source hashes.
The UI, SSH task controller, parsers and bounded runners are additions for this application.
The bounded experiments use different parameters from the upstream research experiments.
Screenshots show this application's interface and a real short-run result; they are not paper results.
